BookDesk: Reading Diary

The reading diary is a safe place to store all your reading books.

BookDesk: Reading Diary is a book reading diary, a fast and convenient application for storing books you have read, books you are currently reading, and books you are planning to read.
You can easily create lists of books to read using the reading diary recommendation system.
The book ratings in the app and the recommendation system will help you choose the right book for you to read.

The main feature is that our reading diary contains four convenient boards for adding books and a huge database of books in which you can easily find using smart search or filtering.
Lightning-fast speed of the application, convenient boards and book status management will help you quickly add books to your reading diary.

Using the BookDesk: Reading Diary application, you can easily organize and sort all your read books, because the application has a board of the same name.
You can also easily and simply plan books for future reading on the board called “Will read” for reading.
And finally, you can add all your books that you are currently reading to the “Read” board.

Advantages of the reading diary:
- Convenient and very fast visual boards will help you store current, planned and read books
- Huge database of books. Constant database updates
- Ability to add custom books with automatic cover selection
- Fast and convenient book search
- All books have a rating, each user can change it
- Powerful mechanism for filtering books by categories and subcategories
- Recommendation system
- Finding suitable books for further reading
- Instant update of book status
- Quickly switch between boards to view the current status of books
- Convenient book design: covers, titles, authors, number of pages
- Ability to view a detailed description of the book
- Adding a book status update date

Now you do not have to worry about storing your books, because our reading diary stores them in one reliable cloud storage.

Become a user of our reading diary and put your ratings and reviews for books, recommend books to other users and store all your books in one safe place.

